{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01510-s01","batch":1510,"shard":1,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":20,"shard_end_exclusive":40,"translated_count":15,"entries":[{"entry_index":20,"uid":"zhcn:360b93f8f7b7fc0b6b67a6c4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"启程吧。向着旅途的尽头…","source_fingerprint":"4859230b12805e0612ae4678686b08c0d2022c7a594a5bbca533cf6f9b50e15d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","40000"],"target_text":"Khởi hành thôi. Hướng tới tận cùng hành trình…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":21,"uid":"zhcn:863ca196b5c0c384e0f0c4ab","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"时机正好。就由我带您踏上…这如梦似幻般的\r\n极致之旅。来吧――","source_fingerprint":"f38854f6acb74c53e4f53f106a6e1b54cc2d4b81dfc927b9d855b683406a09be","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","40001"],"target_text":"Đúng lúc rồi. Hãy để tôi dẫn Trainer bước lên…\r\nhành trình tột đỉnh tựa giấc mơ này. Nào――","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":22,"uid":"zhcn:1bb54ad17be210f7ba252407","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"请由我为您献上梦幻般的舞台吧。","source_fingerprint":"3417b04cb24641b1a33eb1f9f9b417e0add827916c8c504c044681b364476fa1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","60000"],"target_text":"Hãy để tôi dành tặng Trainer một sân khấu tựa như mộng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":23,"uid":"zhcn:d337ef930adec2ee2b5576f3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"向粉丝们致以最诚挚的感谢之情。","source_fingerprint":"6a2edfda92c2841478abd56ab971b4a13323b7c662f74f2a77ea4afbec21a06e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","60001"],"target_text":"Xin gửi lời cảm ơn chân thành nhất đến người hâm mộ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":24,"uid":"zhcn:fc4a7bf9a77f90fa1c3ee11b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"让我们一起去见证旅途的尽头吧。","source_fingerprint":"2cef4d8054d2860e4bfcfca2d0f444192738725dfc39e844caef68987b613a29","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70000"],"target_text":"Chúng ta hãy cùng đi chứng kiến tận cùng hành trình nhé.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":25,"uid":"zhcn:df5d7a30db873ada8634407e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"您的温柔给了我\r\n莫大的支持。对我而言、\r\n您是无可替代的人…训练员","source_fingerprint":"46701983f51ab83931d948736804a2f245bc385259533273529ca0ef25fdc769","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70001"],"target_text":"Sự dịu dàng của Trainer đã dành cho tôi\r\nsự nâng đỡ to lớn. Với tôi,\r\nTrainer là người không ai có thể thay thế…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":26,"uid":"zhcn:7e76057615aecf2115c98f0e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"保养我每天都有在做哦。","source_fingerprint":"4d6b08ff48ab6bbdc28f1ef607ad159ca875c4c94719e4a4fa7b583bae959998","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70004"],"target_text":"Tôi chăm sóc bản thân mỗi ngày đấy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":27,"uid":"zhcn:bcc83c74b5d3224c937feac2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"是件不太常穿的设计呢。","source_fingerprint":"998524118313db8c6c599c23e7c398cde45fccb01b540cc7e688a41f48b4f78c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70008"],"target_text":"Đây là kiểu thiết kế tôi không thường mặc nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":28,"uid":"zhcn:52bbdc987cef06429c22f7ce","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"跟平时给人的印象有所不同吗？\r\n…呵呵。","source_fingerprint":"685eb4d472db0669db808bfcdcb7aee448095e67b7ab939bac65370b5ad9d6d3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70009"],"target_text":"Khác với ấn tượng thường ngày sao?\r\n…Hehe.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":29,"uid":"zhcn:25256bd51b9d4b3527d388ae","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"制服…真是便利的符号。","source_fingerprint":"eae7a2b7c6c7d63c2a79ec3c3145d1ad72c2aa80174109e0700a886061e907fc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70010"],"target_text":"Đồng phục… đúng là một biểu tượng tiện lợi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":30,"uid":"zhcn:5025d8f41ac8dd54c148032a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我算是比较擅长记舞步的。","source_fingerprint":"8781d076a0a36f1fb5f2492665dd95624268f10f711bb027f6c3784d6a7822c5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70014"],"target_text":"Tôi khá giỏi ghi nhớ các bước nhảy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":31,"uid":"zhcn:0ee700c613290451091e1854","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我的骄傲…这就请您过目。","source_fingerprint":"f78401dcdb094c05b0d1d52c903f193a1f2887c46db357dbda778875119dccc5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70015"],"target_text":"Niềm kiêu hãnh của tôi… xin Trainer hãy xem.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":32,"uid":"zhcn:06a8435ad73146b20023e00c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"白色很让你感到意外吗？","source_fingerprint":"03e48faa73bf16b65fc89d0a225c3c97f8ac582d1d55436dde52b7bb8a0377a2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70016"],"target_text":"Màu trắng khiến Trainer bất ngờ lắm sao?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":33,"uid":"zhcn:77504921df90bff11d0c119f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"宴会之上 享受者才是赢家；不是吗？","source_fingerprint":"6db296f10ec5d631e959518ef57632e79058fee72652ad2221c9cdb4b70a8e8b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70017"],"target_text":"Trong yến tiệc, người biết tận hưởng mới là người thắng; phải không?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":34,"uid":"zhcn:ef8451e8ef35598fe38abd83","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"必须根据用途，来区分使用呢。","source_fingerprint":"ac7baffadf7df822349a280ed0ccd62632f5915f6899a6c0d79bc83c9dc72b09","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1119","70018"],"target_text":"Phải phân biệt cách dùng tùy theo mục đích nhỉ.","reviewed":true}]}